  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "YuniLingo is a comprehensive text-to-speech (TTS) plugin for Unreal Engine that provides high-quality, real-time voice synthesis capabilities. The plugin integrates the Piper neural TTS engine through a carefully designed bridge architecture that solves C++ runtime compatibility issues between Unreal Engine and third-party libraries."
        ],
        "items": {
          "title": "Key Features",
          "items": [
            "Real-time synthesis: Batch and streaming audio generation",
            "Multi-language support: Language-based voice selection with fallback chains",
            "Voice management: Dynamic loading/unloading with memory management",
            "Audio caching: LRU cache for repeated text synthesis",
            "Spatial audio: 3D positional audio support",
            "Blueprint integration: Full visual scripting support",
            "Performance optimization: Async processing and memory-efficient caching",
            "Threading Model with proper synchronization",
            "Memory Management with LRU caching",
            "Error Handling and debugging support"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Technologies Used",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "items": {
          "title": "",
          "items": [
            "Unreal Engine 5.x",
            "C++",
            "Piper TTS",
            "ONNX Runtime",
            "eSpeak-ng"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Architecture",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "YuniLingo follows a layered architecture with clear separation of concerns:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Architecture Diagram",
              "description": [
                "```",
                "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐",
                "│                    Unreal Engine                            │",
                "│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │",
                "│  │                YuniLingo Plugin                     │    │",
                "│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │    │",
                "│  │  │           Application Layer                     │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - UYuniLingoComponent (Actor Component)       │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - UYuniLingoSubsystem (World Subsystem)       │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - Blueprint Function Library                   │ │    │",
                "│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │    │",
                "│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │    │",
                "│  │  │           Service Layer                         │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - FYuniLingoVoiceManager (Voice Registry)     │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - FPiperAsyncManager (Async Processing)       │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - UYuniLingoAudioCache (Audio Caching)        │ │    │",
                "│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │    │",
                "│  │  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │    │",
                "│  │  │           Bridge Layer                          │ │    │",
                "│  │  │  - PiperBridge.dll (C++ Runtime Isolation)     │ │    │",
                "│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │    │",
                "│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │",
                "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
                "                   │",
                "                   ▼",
                "┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐",
                "│                 Piper TTS Engine                           │",
                "│  - Neural voice synthesis                                  │",
                "│  - Phoneme processing                                      │",
                "│  - Audio generation                                        │",
                "└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Design Principles",
              "description": [
                "- Separation of Concerns: Each layer has a specific responsibility",
                "- Thread Safety: Async operations with proper synchronization",
                "- Memory Efficiency: LRU caching and voice management",
                "- Runtime Isolation: Bridge DLL prevents C++ runtime conflicts",
                "- Extensibility: Plugin architecture allows for future enhancements"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Core Components",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Core Components",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "UYuniLingoComponent",
              "description": [
                "Purpose: Actor component providing TTS capabilities to any Unreal actor",
                "",
                "Key Features:",
                "- Voice configuration per component",
                "- Automatic audio playback with spatialization",
                "- Streaming and batch synthesis modes",
                "- Event-driven architecture (Blueprint events)",
                "- Voice caching for performance",
                "",
                "Usage:",
                "```cpp",
                "// Attach to any actor",
                "UYuniLingoComponent* TTSComponent = NewObject<UYuniLingoComponent>(Actor);",
                "TTSComponent->SetVoice(VoiceConfig);",
                "FGuid RequestID = TTSComponent->Speak(TEXT(\"Hello world\"));",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "UYuniLingoSubsystem",
              "description": [
                "Purpose: World subsystem managing global TTS operations",
                "",
                "Responsibilities:",
                "- Voice loading and lifecycle management",
                "- Synthesis queue processing",
                "- Audio cache management",
                "- Global event broadcasting",
                "- Memory management across the world",
                "",
                "Key Methods:",
                "- LoadVoice() / LoadVoiceAsync() - Voice management",
                "- QueueSynthesis()               - Async synthesis requests",
                "- ClearCache()                   - Cache management"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "FYuniLingoVoiceManager",
              "description": [
                "Purpose: Low-level voice model management and Piper integration",
                "",
                "Features:",
                "- Voice instance registry with thread-safe access",
                "- PiperBridge integration",
                "- Memory-efficient voice loading/unloading",
                "- Thread-safe synthesis operations"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "FPiperAsyncManager",
              "description": [
                "Purpose: Asynchronous task execution engine",
                "",
                "Capabilities:",
                "- Background synthesis processing",
                "- Voice loading tasks",
                "- Thread-safe callback marshaling",
                "- Task cancellation and monitoring"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Data Structures",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Core data structures for TTS operations:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Data Structures",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "struct FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings",
                "{",
                "    float SpeedMultiplier = 1.0f;        // Speech speed (0.25-4.0)",
                "    float NoiseScale = 0.667f;           // Voice variation (0.0-1.0)",
                "    float NoiseW = 0.8f;                 // Phoneme timing variation (0.0-1.0)",
                "    int32 SpeakerID = 0;                 // Multi-speaker voice selection",
                "    float Volume = 1.0f;                 // Audio volume (0.0-2.0)",
                "    float PitchShift = 0.0f;             // Pitch adjustment in semitones",
                "    EYuniLingoSynthesisMode SynthesisMode = EYuniLingoSynthesisMode::Streaming;",
                "    bool bEnableCaching = true;          // Use audio cache",
                "    FString LanguageCode;                // Target language for voice selection",
                "};",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "FYuniLingoSynthesisResult",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "struct FYuniLingoSynthesisResult",
                "{",
                "    FGuid RequestID;                     // Unique request identifier",
                "    TObjectPtr<USoundWave> Audio;        // Generated audio (batch mode)",
                "    EYuniLingoSynthesisStatus Status;    // Completion status",
                "    FText ErrorMessage;                  // Error details if failed",
                "    float Duration;                      // Audio duration in seconds",
                "    float ProcessingTime;                // Synthesis time",
                "    bool bFromCache;                     // Whether result came from cache",
                "};",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "UYuniLingoVoiceConfig",
              "description": "Data asset representing a single Piper voice model: Model and config file paths, Language and quality metadata, Speaker configuration, Default synthesis settings"
            },
            {
              "element": "UYuniLingoVoiceSet",
              "description": "Collection of voices for different languages/entities: Language-to-voice mapping, Priority-based fallback selection, Entity-specific voice collections"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "API Design",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Comprehensive API support for both Blueprint and C++ development:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "API Interfaces",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Blueprint Component Interface",
              "description": [
                "```blueprint",
                "// Basic synthesis",
                "FGuid Speak(FText Text, bool bOverrideSettings, FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings CustomSettings)",
                "",
                "// Localized synthesis",
                "FGuid SpeakLocalized(FText Text, FString LanguageCode, bool bOverrideSettings, FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings CustomSettings)",
                "",
                "// Streaming synthesis",
                "FGuid SpeakStreaming(FText Text, bool bOverrideSettings, FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings CustomSettings)",
                "",
                "// Playback control",
                "void PlayAudio(UYuniLingoSoundWaveProcedural* Audio)",
                "void StopAudio()",
                "bool IsPlayingAudio()",
                "",
                "// Voice management",
                "void SetVoice(UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* Voice)",
                "UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* GetVoice()",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Blueprint Function Library",
              "description": [
                "```blueprint",
                "// Voice discovery",
                "TArray<UYuniLingoVoiceConfig*> GetAvailableVoices()",
                "UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* FindVoiceByID(FName VoiceID)",
                "TArray<UYuniLingoVoiceConfig*> FindVoicesByLanguage(FString LanguageCode)",
                "",
                "// Quick synthesis",
                "void QuickSpeak(FText Text, UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* Voice)",
                "FGuid QuickSynthesize(FText Text, UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* Voice)",
                "",
                "// Cache management",
                "void ClearAudioCache()",
                "void GetCacheStatistics(int32& EntryCount, float& SizeMB)",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "C++ API",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "// Async action for Blueprint latent nodes",
                "UYuniLingoAsyncAction_Synthesize* UYuniLingoAsyncAction_Synthesize::SynthesizeTextAsync(",
                "    UObject* WorldContextObject,",
                "    const FText& Text,",
                "    UYuniLingoVoiceConfig* Voice,",
                "    const FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings& Settings",
                ");",
                "",
                "// Direct subsystem access",
                "UYuniLingoSubsystem* TTSSubsystem = World->GetSubsystem<UYuniLingoSubsystem>();",
                "",
                "// Load voice",
                "bool bSuccess = TTSSubsystem->LoadVoice(VoiceConfig);",
                "",
                "// Queue synthesis",
                "FGuid RequestID = TTSSubsystem->QueueSynthesis(Text, VoiceConfig, Settings);",
                "",
                "// Get results",
                "FYuniLingoSynthesisResult Result;",
                "if (TTSSubsystem->GetSynthesisResult(RequestID, Result)) {",
                "    // Handle result",
                "}",
                "```"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Audio Pipeline",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Complete audio processing chain from text to spatial audio:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Audio Processing Pipeline",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Audio Processing Chain",
              "description": [
                "```",
                "Text Input",
                "    ↓",
                "Phonemization (eSpeak-ng)",
                "    ↓",
                "Neural Synthesis (ONNX Runtime)",
                "    ↓",
                "Audio Post-Processing",
                "    ↓",
                "PCM Audio Buffer",
                "    ↓",
                "UYuniLingoSoundWaveProcedural",
                "    ↓",
                "Unreal Audio Engine",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Batch Mode",
              "description": "Complete audio buffer generation for pre-generated dialogue. Single USoundWaveProcedural with full audio data. Best for non-real-time applications."
            },
            {
              "element": "Streaming Mode",
              "description": "Progressive audio chunk generation for real-time conversation. UYuniLingoStreamingAudioPlayer with real-time audio feeding. Ideal for dynamic content."
            },
            {
              "element": "Audio Cache System",
              "description": [
                "LRU cache with hash-based keys for repeated text synthesis. Priority calculation: (RecencyScore * FrequencyScore) with configurable size limits.",
                "",
                "```cpp",
                "uint32 CreateCacheKey(const FText& Text, const FYuniLingoSynthesisSettings& Settings) {",
                "    FString KeyString = Text.ToString();",
                "    KeyString += FString::Printf(TEXT(\"_%.2f_%.2f_%.2f_%d_%.2f_%.2f_%d_%d_%d\"),",
                "        Settings.SpeedMultiplier, Settings.NoiseScale, Settings.NoiseW,",
                "        Settings.SpeakerID, Settings.Volume, Settings.PitchShift,",
                "        (int32)Settings.SynthesisMode, Settings.bEnableCaching ? 1 : 0,",
                "        Settings.bProcessSSML ? 1 : 0);",
                "    return GetTypeHash(KeyString);",
                "}",
                "```"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Threading Model",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Robust multi-threading architecture for optimal performance:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Threading Architecture",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Game Thread",
              "description": "Component lifecycle, Blueprint calls, UI updates, event broadcasting, voice configuration changes"
            },
            {
              "element": "Background Threads (AsyncTask)",
              "description": "Neural synthesis operations, Voice model loading/unloading, Audio data processing, File I/O operations"
            },
            {
              "element": "Synchronization",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "// Voice registry access",
                "FCriticalSection VoiceCriticalSection;",
                "",
                "// Task management",
                "FCriticalSection TaskCriticalSection;",
                "",
                "// Cache operations",
                "FCriticalSection CacheCriticalSection;",
                "```",
                "",
                "Thread-safe operations: Voice instance access (shared pointers), Cache get/set operations, Task queue management, Result retrieval"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Callback Marshaling",
              "description": [
                "All background thread callbacks are marshaled to game thread:",
                "",
                "```cpp",
                "AsyncTask(ENamedThreads::GameThread, [TaskData, bSuccess, AudioData, SampleRate]() {",
                "    if (TaskData->CompletionCallback) {",
                "        TaskData->CompletionCallback(bSuccess, AudioData, SampleRate);",
                "    }",
                "});",
                "```"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Memory Management",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Comprehensive memory management strategies:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Memory Management Strategies",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Voice Memory Management",
              "description": "LRU voice cache (configurable max voices, default: 3). Loading strategy: Check cache → Async loading → Dependency resolution → Memory limits enforcement"
            },
            {
              "element": "Audio Memory Management",
              "description": "Streaming mode: Minimal footprint with progressive feeding. Batch mode: Full buffer in memory. Procedural sound waves with automatic cleanup on playback finish. Cache size management with LRU and configurable limits."
            },
            {
              "element": "Runtime Isolation",
              "description": [
                "PiperBridge.dll architecture preventing heap corruption between mixed runtimes:",
                "",
                "```",
                "Unreal Engine (/MDd) ←→ PiperBridge.dll (/MD) ←→ Piper Libraries (/MD)",
                "                      malloc/free              new/delete",
                "```",
                "",
                "Benefits: No heap corruption from mixed runtimes, Clean memory ownership boundaries, Stable across Debug/Release builds"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Error Handling",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Comprehensive error handling system:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Error Handling System",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Error Categories",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "enum class EYuniLingoErrorCategory : uint8",
                "{",
                "    None,",
                "    VoiceLoading,      // Voice model load failures",
                "    Synthesis,         // Neural synthesis errors",
                "    AudioConversion,   // PCM to Unreal audio conversion",
                "    FileSystem,        // File access issues",
                "    Memory,           // Memory allocation failures",
                "    Threading,        // Thread synchronization issues",
                "    Configuration     // Invalid settings/configuration",
                "};",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Global Error Handler",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "class FYuniLingoErrorHandler",
                "{",
                "public:",
                "    static void ReportError(const FYuniLingoError& Error);",
                "    static FYuniLingoError GetLastError();",
                "    static void ClearLastError();",
                "};",
                "```"
              ]
            },
            {
              "element": "Error Macros",
              "description": [
                "```cpp",
                "#define YUNILINGO_ERROR(Category, Message, ...) \\",
                "    FYuniLingoErrorHandler::ReportError(FYuniLingoError::Make( \\",
                "        EYuniLingoErrorCategory::Category, \\",
                "        EYuniLingoErrorSeverity::Error, \\",
                "        __LINE__, \\",
                "        FText::FromString(FString::Printf(TEXT(Message), ##__VA_ARGS__)), \\",
                "        FString::Printf(TEXT(\"%s:%d\"), TEXT(__FILE__), __LINE__) \\",
                "    ))",
                "```"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Performance Considerations",
      "type": "complex",
      "content": {
        "description": [
          "Performance optimization strategies:"
        ],
        "coreElements": {
          "title": "Performance Optimizations",
          "elements": [
            {
              "element": "Voice Preloading",
              "description": "Startup loading for marked voices, background loading for non-blocking preparation, configurable voice limits"
            },
            {
              "element": "Audio Caching",
              "description": "Hash-based keys for fast lookups, LRU eviction, configurable size limits to prevent memory exhaustion"
            },
            {
              "element": "Async Processing",
              "description": "Background synthesis for non-blocking generation, task prioritization for critical operations, resource pooling for voice instance reuse"
            },
            {
              "element": "Performance Metrics",
              "description": "Real-time factor monitoring (processing_time/audio_duration, target <1.0), memory usage tracking (~50MB per voice model), streaming memory footprint optimization"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
